{"id":2389,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为传递积极向上的成长力量，启发同学们对职业发展与自我成长的深度思考，3月22日晚七点，中北大学“一站式”学生社区博雅书院举办“影释人生”主题观影活动，带领同学们在光影中探寻职业初心、汲取奋进力量。此次活动精选经典励志影片《穿普拉达的女王》，影片生动刻画了女主角安迪·萨克斯从职场新人的懵懂迷茫，到突破自我、完成成长蜕变的历程。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bLzrEkL4laM4NZLe4LZU4VVozM2LR7yZnmTknzL8LlMVLzC0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh2MkhRLYyZo7lanllsn7nRUmUbM8lDoRvsL4l8L7-YMRWFU4nRL7-YL4TFLl-YnRGJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4L4GsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33307&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1F4C388E0EE7DDCB497E68773540B242/C4C0B239/1B2D0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bnR9EZolV2Mm7iLel7Zo7VRUNU8Mz-yZLzLsL4rVMzl8nRl0gihFp2hmCIa0USysL1h2MSyDnNlsMzvPMlW7oz6fnmA7LRvPMRf7nmTfozrFU4vaozLbLmTFU49bU4LJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4L4GsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33307&e=.png\"></p><p>影片中，安迪从最初对时尚行业的陌生抵触，到沉下心适应工作、锤炼专业能力，在迎合行业与坚守本心之间反复权衡，最终认清自我需求，既收获了职场成长的底气，也坚守了内心初心。影片落幕後，同学们纷纷分享观影感悟，围绕“职场新人适应环境”“初心与妥协的平衡”等话题展开热烈探讨，让活动超越了“看电影”本身，成为一次职场认知的启蒙与自我成长的反思。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bnRvEZUzG4UmVRUezTVL77sUmUPU8-yiL4-aU8-bnz9YoR-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSh2okhRU1h7LzlDLNC8L4Ubo7WfoRCbMR62LR9Ynz-DLznFLNLDLlr7M4rFLzrfMR7Jv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4L4GsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33307&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EF8CBD1562F43498BA86947F082E2614/2C61ED75/15A41\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bo7QE7ozTRMR67Me8-DUNCbLRrVolUyYMlWRoRAfLz9Dn7l0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhkMSyZL1hRU46VUl-inR67Umv8nR7inmL8L7LPLmGsUNQFLRGZnlrRLzrFU49bU4LJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4L4GsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33307&e=.png\"></p><p>本次活动是博雅书院将职业规划教育融入日常育人场景的生动实践，书院将持续依托“影释人生”品牌活动，搭建职业探索与成长交流的坚实平台，引导广大同学在职业道路探索中认清自我、坚定初心、脚踏实地，在奋进中成长、在坚守中绽放，奔赴属于自己的精彩未来。</p><p>一审一校 郭鹏丽</p><p>二审二校 王熠暄</p><p>三审三校 王慧慧</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bLzrEkL4laM4NZLe4LZU4VVozM2LR7yZnmTknzL8LlMVLzC0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh2MkhRLYyZo7lanllsn7nRUmUbM8lDoRvsL4l8L7-YMRWFU4nRL7-YL4TFLl-YnRGJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4L4GsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33307&e=.png"}